This product is an independent Android port that was developed with reference to
ARTEMIS (https://github.com/google/artemis), Copyright 2026 Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications relative to ARTEMIS: the Flash observe-and-act loop, its tool set,
element-index-first targeting and the model provider registry were re-implemented in
Java to run entirely on the phone through an Android accessibility service, instead of
a host computer driving the device over adb. The floating bubble, run history, run
details, voice wake-up, Chinese / English UI and the Android app itself are new.

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Google.

